{"name": "SWORD FLINGER", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/0f491fca868cab80ccbe5e15b2201b39.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/9137c808419db4683ea68149ca0e4443.poster.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/9137c808419db4683ea68149ca0e4443.webm?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/9137c808419db4683ea68149ca0e4443.mp4?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SWORD FLINGER is a roguelite action game where you fight by throwing a variety of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swords fly in arcs, spears shoot straight, axes are heavy but hit hard, and scythes spin through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon also comes with its own unique abilities. Master them all and find your perfect arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/33d210bd75895d37e71f7b4c3dc72dd0.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/6a6b623c635900cbd3017f8c9e223bba.poster.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/6a6b623c635900cbd3017f8c9e223bba.webm?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/6a6b623c635900cbd3017f8c9e223bba.mp4?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even the slightest change in angle can dramatically alter your weapon's trajectory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop the Shot Gauge at just the right moment to deal extra damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your angle and power to land the perfect shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/5150bb96de89f73ebb65c92a02a16d9d.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/710f653d7dc2d30b936b0aee2c353db5.poster.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/710f653d7dc2d30b936b0aee2c353db5.webm?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/710f653d7dc2d30b936b0aee2c353db5.mp4?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you throw a weapon, the enemy's action counter decreases. When it reaches zero, they attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if your weapon returns to you, you'll trigger ONE MORE CHANCE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw the same weapon again without advancing the enemy's turn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/ce31aff3a99f86b2d6b1b25a28711651.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/629ee202edf27787c71c5d5f82cef0ca.poster.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/629ee202edf27787c71c5d5f82cef0ca.webm?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/629ee202edf27787c71c5d5f82cef0ca.mp4?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up and clear stages to earn rewards and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/14c642af0af33e23d664c631a1310a32.poster.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/14c642af0af33e23d664c631a1310a32.webm?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/14c642af0af33e23d664c631a1310a32.mp4?t=1792139224\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use active skills and items, or raise your shield to block incoming attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine everything you find and create your own way to fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/bc633b915deb5a161b9219e9985d2605.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"260\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/extras/4c2b50446407a7e699bb4ee774881b50.avif?t=1792139224\" width=\"560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken with no memories\u2014and a mysterious gauntlet attached to your right arm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Memory Fragments throughout the labyrinth to improve your starting abilities as you uncover the truth behind your lost memories and the mysterious gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Throw swords to fight in this roguelite chain-action game. Weapons bounce off walls and enemies, chaining hits from one foe to another. Build damage bonuses with every chain and dive deeper into ever-changing dungeons while collecting swords, spears, axes, staves, shields, and more.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474400/930b0efe9cd0a881a217a80764a3104dab8a3761/header.jpg?t=1792139224", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["2D Platformer", "Action", "Roguelite", "Casual", "Puzzle", "PvE"], "developers": "TOM CREATE CO.,LTD.", "publishers": "TOM CREATE CO.,LTD.", "release_date": "Oct 14, 2026", "price": "$3.49", "appid": "4474400", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ydWgDJ_C7SM", "first_seen": 1792015200.0, "review_rank": 36}